{"id": "DeRdV4OjhM-", "title": "Video by index.opensource", "description": "A grid of numbers becomes flickering pixel fire.\n\ndoom-fire-algorithm starts with a row of 36s. It reads the value below, subtracts a random 0, 1 or 2 (never below zero), and writes the result toward the left. A 37-entry palette turns those values into animated color. Turn the bottom row off and the fire fades.\n\nA small JavaScript experiment for learning palette animation and building stylized pixel effects. The fire values come from the project's original fire.js; the enlarged grids, palette layout, annotations and timing presentation were made for this video.\n\n\uc22b\uc790 \uaca9\uc790\uac00 \uc77c\ub801\uc774\ub294 \ud53d\uc140 \ubd88\uaf43\uc774 \ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\ndoom-fire-algorithm\uc740 \ub9e8 \uc544\ub7ab\uc904\uc744 36\uc73c\ub85c \ucc44\uc6b0\uace0 \uc2dc\uc791\ud574\uc694. \uc544\ub798 \uce78\uc758 \uac12\uc5d0\uc11c \ubb34\uc791\uc704\ub85c 0\u00b71\u00b72\ub97c \ube7c\uace0, 0\ubcf4\ub2e4 \uc791\uc544\uc9c0\uc9c0 \uc54a\uac8c \ud55c \ub4a4 \uc67c\ucabd\uc73c\ub85c \uc62e\uaca8 \uc801\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. 37\uce78 \ud314\ub808\ud2b8\ub85c \uc22b\uc790\ub97c \uc0c9\uc5d0 \uc5f0\uacb0\ud558\uba74 \ubd88\uaf43\uc774 \uc6c0\uc9c1\uc5ec\uc694. \ub9e8 \uc544\ub7ab\uc904\uc744 0\uc73c\ub85c \ubc14\uafb8\uba74 \uc11c\uc11c\ud788 \uaebc\uc9c0\uace0\uc694.\n\n\ud314\ub808\ud2b8 \uc560\ub2c8\uba54\uc774\uc158\uc744 \ubc30\uc6b0\uac70\ub098 \ud53d\uc140 \uc774\ud399\ud2b8\ub97c \ub9cc\ub4e4\uc5b4 \ubcfc \uc218 \uc788\ub294 JavaScript \uc2e4\ud5d8\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubd88\uaf43 \uac12\uc740 \uc6d0\ubcf8 fire.js\uac00 \uacc4\uc0b0\ud588\uace0, \ud655\ub300 \uaca9\uc790\u00b7\ud314\ub808\ud2b8 \ubc30\uce58\u00b7\uc124\uba85 \ud45c\uc2dc\u00b7\uc7ac\uc0dd \uc5f0\ucd9c\uc740 \uc601\uc0c1\uc6a9\uc73c\ub85c \ub9cc\ub4e4\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nSource: doom-fire-algorithm by Filipe Deschamps \u00b7 MIT\nhttps://github.com/filipedeschamps/doom-fire-algorithm\nImplementation: playground/1st-implementation-with-tables\nInspired by \u201cHow DOOM fire was done\u201d by Fabien Sanglard\nhttps://fabiensanglard.net/doom_fire_psx/\n\n#indexopensource #opensource #creativecoding #javascript #pixelart", "channel": "index.opensource", "uploader_id": "60040254965", "uploader": "index.opensource", "timestamp": 1791547203, "like_count": 54284, "comment_count": 254, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2093510491270435a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 53.273, "asr": 48000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPL0EIgX6e7DoYEztJN_tK7DOwjAzQnqSIY32eQu98zZwxbOvm0Fv36mRKgAAncMYcmliUNAUabDaLDqI152qQjaEZw6da365RiXD8.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=YLojEqN0GQEQ7kNvwEnBG07&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=YurXAn24VsvzMe8GvB0pZg&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQNv7Yf3dZ08559Vs_7A0j7thXQpfje0LKfaJvz53-Qvhg&oe=6AE202B4", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 53.273, "resolution": "audio only", "aspect_ratio": null, "filesize_approx": null, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-20935104